[{:db/id "q-334327/selection/17c3a3f220bab1e9c5b09c87db5b7bd442af0e8ec4f555567c2cd813fdbcf3b0" :answer/id #uuid "bd282eeb-5b18-5185-a040-3d29e82befd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327/selection/b2dd6a61999c20b1a9c1c6d7d246d6857829aa0b550f8d81174845f2a334b14b" :answer/id #uuid "2b367198-849f-539f-b636-0c6270db23c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2t \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327/selection/0053334970d69521b31488125867609f52b0dcb2080c6a870430c6d0eeb345b0" :answer/id #uuid "c1be1813-9918-5c3c-b803-e4522997ca9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{3t} & 2t{e}^{3t} \\\\ 0 & -{e}^{3t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327/selection/cbdfb3606a2343c195affcc2e995c7edf904ed436af924836a91f27684ce1ccf" :answer/id #uuid "295291d9-92f9-54ec-954d-6a24da5e8117" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{3} & 2{e}^{3} \\\\ 0 & -{e}^{3}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327/selection/16bd2d3ceaed1680e4af44dd2eae07946e5f4899a9ce502e5fd8e6f6d2817daa" :answer/id #uuid "31f46cad-178e-54e3-a3b7-7e2bcaa65f3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-{e}^{3t} & 0 \\\\ 2t{e}^{3t} & 2{e}^{3t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5994ca9d-a3de-55a5-ad78-f605e2fdb21d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-334327/selection/0053334970d69521b31488125867609f52b0dcb2080c6a870430c6d0eeb345b0" :answer-field/choices ["q-334327/selection/17c3a3f220bab1e9c5b09c87db5b7bd442af0e8ec4f555567c2cd813fdbcf3b0" "q-334327/selection/b2dd6a61999c20b1a9c1c6d7d246d6857829aa0b550f8d81174845f2a334b14b" "q-334327/selection/0053334970d69521b31488125867609f52b0dcb2080c6a870430c6d0eeb345b0" "q-334327/selection/cbdfb3606a2343c195affcc2e995c7edf904ed436af924836a91f27684ce1ccf" "q-334327/selection/16bd2d3ceaed1680e4af44dd2eae07946e5f4899a9ce502e5fd8e6f6d2817daa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-334327" :question/id #uuid "f8c6b8e4-9384-55da-a01b-d2f8d4316b1a" :question/math-academy-id "q-334327" :question/problem "$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]x,\\,{x}_{1}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t},\\,{x}_{2}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2t \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear ODEs and two of its linearly independent solutions ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2},$ shown above. Which of the following is a fundamental matrix for the system?" :question/worked-solution "Given a linear system ${x}^{′}=Ax,$ where $A$ is an $n\\times n$ matrix, a *fundamental matrix* $Φ(t)$ of the system is an $n\\times n$ matrix whose columns are linearly independent solutions of the system.\n\nIn our case, we have a $2\\times 2$ system. We are also given that the two linearly independent solutions of the system are the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}=[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{3t} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}2t \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}=[\\begin{aligned}2t{e}^{3t} \\\\ -{e}^{3t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, our fundamental could be written as\n\n$$\nΦ(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{3t} & 2t{e}^{3t} \\\\ 0 & -{e}^{3t}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Note:** The columns of $Φ$ can be written in any order." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-334327/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "af871f3d-da9e-5fd3-a61f-94e155ccf2b3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-334327"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-334329"] :question/problem "$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]x,\\,{x}_{1}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t},\\,{x}_{2}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear ODEs and two of its linearly independent solutions ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2},$ shown above. Which of the following is a fundamental matrix for the system?" :question/worked-solution "Given a linear system ${x}^{′}=Ax,$ where $A$ is an $n\\times n$ matrix, a *fundamental matrix* $Φ(t)$ of the system is an $n\\times n$ matrix whose columns are linearly independent solutions of the system.\n\nIn our case, we have a $2\\times 2$ system. We are also given that the two linearly independent solutions of the system are the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t}=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t}=[\\begin{aligned}-{e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, our fundamental could be written as\n\n$$\nΦ(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t & -{e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t & {e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Note:** The columns of $Φ$ can be written in any order." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-334330/selection/e9e8bfc6f708f6bbb9c96437572fef6034e3d826bb4b2ec78bd89e58a23f5df5" :answer/id #uuid "d7b3222f-3bb6-5226-a388-b4a52b3dfec0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-1}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2 & -{e}^{-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2 \\\\ {e}^{-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2 & {e}^{-1}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/valida